1284
01:13:37,366 --> 01:13:40,133
For the sake of—

1285
01:13:40,133 --> 01:13:44,400
For the sake of having clean geometry
to cut through,

1286
01:13:44,700 --> 01:13:49,733
we are keeping it simple by modeling 
with quads. Quads,

1287
01:13:50,133 --> 01:13:54,100
I kid you not,
I would not try to attempt

1288
01:13:54,100 --> 01:13:57,100
to model with tris

1289
01:13:57,100 --> 01:13:58,533
because you will—

1290
01:13:58,533 --> 01:14:01,100
