1294
01:14:07,966 --> 01:14:11,233
You may end up with non-manifold.

1295
01:14:11,666 --> 01:14:15,066
It's just a lot of weird issues
that would happen.

1296
01:14:15,066 --> 01:14:19,700
So, when you're modeling
keep your models

1297
01:14:20,466 --> 01:14:24,133
to quads at first,
and then when you need to like decimate

1298
01:14:24,133 --> 01:14:27,933
or something, the decimation
will create the tris for you.

1299
01:14:28,500 --> 01:14:31,500
That's just a little tip.

1300
01:14:32,533 --> 01:14:34,600
And that's if you are

1301
