1303
01:14:40,633 --> 01:14:44,500
but you have to be careful with that, too,
because you may lose some shape.

1304
01:14:44,900 --> 01:14:46,733
So it really depends.

1305
01:14:57,200 --> 01:14:59,666
No, 
you won’t.

1306
01:14:59,666 --> 01:15:01,333
It’s...

1307
01:15:01,333 --> 01:15:04,333
It’s kind of like a hit or miss, for sure.

